00:26:28,600 --> 00:26:33,550
So, in short, the compiler does a lot of the hard work to guarantee.

414
00:26:33,550 --> 00:26:35,390
that the program runs correctly, and.

415
00:26:35,390 --> 00:26:40,030
so the need for a runtime is much less than in other languages, on other platforms.

